WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.851 --> 00:00:14.569
Baa! Baa!

2
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.820
The Royal Bedroom was full of sheep!

3
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.080
"Sheep!" the queen yelled.

4
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.940
She jumped into the king's arms.

5
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.500
Tom stared at the sheep.

6
00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.420
"Oops!" he said.

7
00:00:28.555 --> 00:00:30.415
Dirk grinned.

8
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.500
"Now Tom will go to the Grim Dungeon!" he thought.

9
00:00:37.219 --> 00:00:42.224
"What's going on?" the king roared.

10
00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.440
He walked among the sheep.

11
00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.480
Dirk followed the king.

12
00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:50.120
Then the king turned—and stepped on Dirk's foot.

13
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.100
"Ouch!" Dirk hopped behind the king.

14
00:00:55.709 --> 00:00:59.129
"Your Majesty, I told Tom to make a drink!

15
00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:01.350
I didn't say sheep!"

16
00:01:01.555 --> 00:01:04.055
"Hrmpf!" the king said.

17
00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:07.789
"There are so many sheep!" the queen cried.

18
00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:14.090
The king began counting them. "One, two . . ."

19
00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:21.460
His eyelids felt heavy and he yawned.

20
00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:25.980
Suddenly the king fell—into Tom's arms!

21
00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.940
The king slept until the next morning.

22
00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:38.850
Tom and Cat brought the sheep outside.

23
00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.720
The sheep stayed under the king's window.

24
00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:59.580
Every night the king fell asleep—counting sheep!

25
00:02:06.101 --> 00:02:10.795
"I fall asleep before I count to ten," the king said.

26
00:02:10.796 --> 00:02:14.980
"Thank you, Tom!"

27
00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:19.160
Dirk was stuck taking care of the sheep.

28
00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:22.980
"I'll get that wizard!" he grumbled.

29
00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:28.580
The king was happy.

30
00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.639
But the queen was not.

31
00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:35.900
She still couldn't get any beauty sleep.

32
00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.360
The king's snoring kept her awake!
